8:| 1 | Tall front gable over entry | cross-gable `$MCD roof` (style gable, pitch 1.0, rise 5), ridge along z, dark-slate palette, gable face z=7 filled with `birch_planks`, quartz raking trim (verge `quartz_slab`/`quartz_stairs`), round vent 2x2 `glass_pane` framed by `quartz_block` | rect x22..31 z7..18, y10..14 | P3 | roofSpec |
9:| 2 | Hipped wings | hip roofs, dark-slate: main hip rect [18,11,35,25] (ridge y=13), east wing hip [35,12,42,24] (ridge y=12), garage hip [1,7,17,24] (ridge y=12) | see plan SITE | P3 | roofSpec |
10:| 3 | Turret-ish bay | 5x5 chamfered block (corners (38,8),(42,8) cut) walls y1..9, windows, cone `tower-cap` roof, `lightning_rod` finial at y=14 | x38..42 z8..12 | P1 + P3 | turretWalls, roofSpec |
11:| 4 | Dormers (5) | `mcd roof --dormers`: gabled dormer = 3x3 `birch_planks` cheeks, `glass_pane` front, dark-slate roof, quartz trim. Garage north slope x=4 and x=13; wing north slope x=39; main south slope x=21 and x=31 | on roof slopes | P3 | roofSpec |
19:| 12 | Three-car garage wing | 17x18 block x1..17 z7..24, walls y1..9, ground inner x2..16 z8..17 air y1..4, 3 openings 4 wide x 3 high | x1..17 z7..24 | P2 | garageWing |
20:| 13 | Carriage-style garage doors | per bay x0..x0+3: y1..2 `white_concrete` panel; `dark_oak_trapdoor` open facing north on the outside plane z=6 at (x0+1,y1),(x0+1,y2),(x0+2,y1),(x0+2,y2) as bracing; y3 row: x0 and x0+3 `white_concrete`, x0+1,x0+2 `glass_pane`; `quartz_slab` hood at y=4; bays x0 = 3, 8, 13 | z=7 | P4 | carriageDoor |
21:| 14 | Tall arched windows | every window = `archWindow`: glass_pane fill, `quartz_stairs` upside-down arch caps at top corners, `quartz_slab` sill, exact list in plan OPENINGS | plan OPENINGS | P4 | archWindow |
23:| 16 | Big chimney | stone chimney 3x2 with shoulders: `stone_bricks` shaft y1..14 at x39..41 z25..26, `andesite` accent courses, cap `stone_brick_slab` ring + 2 pots (`stone_brick_wall`) at y14 | x39..41 z25..26 y1..14 | P3 | chimney |
30:| 23 | Chandelier | interior designer: `iron_chain` x3 from ceiling y=9 down to y=7 over (27,*,14), `lantern` x4 ring | foyer | room designer | n/a |
34:| 27 | Mudroom off garage | [2..16,19..23], door (15,1..2,18) | rooms | room designers | n/a |
37:| 30 | Bonus room over garage | [2..16,6..8,8..23] | rooms | room designer | n/a |
